  "recipe": {
    "composition": "Huge lowercase grotesque headlines set top-left; near-black pages alternate with full fire-orange pages (cover, chapters, closing and every few content pages); one hairline rule and small mono labels as the only chrome.",
    "components": "Open blocks under a thin orange top rule, bare oversized numerals, numbered steps joined by arrows; the highlighted block inverts to a solid orange (or black on orange) panel. No rounded card grids, no second accent colour.",
    "narrative": "Headline claim, chapter, thesis, evidence with numbers, before/after, how it works, ask.",
    "nativeCoverage": "Cover, chapter, statement, quote, split text with image region, stat row, list, comparison, bar chart, numbered process and closing as native text, shapes and chart. Pie is a native pie (no donut hole or side legend), the stepped hierarchy becomes a centred pyramid, the vertical timeline becomes horizontal, the 2x2 loop becomes a row with a callout; the fading right-aligned word stack, Barlow / IBM Plex Mono and slide transitions are not reproduced."
  },
